# ---- Misc -------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.pid
*.seed
*.tgz
tmp/
temp/
scratch/

# Request logs from a reader session. The measurement belongs in docs/notes.md;
# the raw log is one session's working data and grows every run.
*.jsonl

# Visual brainstorming companion mockups, subagent review packages, and the
# progress ledger. Session working files.
.superpowers/

# Generated by scripts/build-wasm.sh from crates/taiyaku-wasm. A build
# artefact of a crate in this repository; committing it would be a second
# source of truth for what the binding does.
crates/taiyaku-wasm/pkg/

# Vitest browser mode writes a screenshot beside a test when it fails. Useful
# while debugging, never source.
web/src/__screenshots__/

# The same rule, for the directory Vitest actually uses for attachments —
# content-addressed filenames, written on a failing or screenshotting run.
# Seven of them were committed across two PRs (#35 and #59) before this line
# existed, and referenced by nothing. The rule above was written for the right
# reason and pointed at the wrong path.
web/.vitest-attachments/

# A screenshot of the labeller's toolbar, committed in #59 and referenced by no
# markdown, HTML, CSS, TypeScript, Rust or config file. Named rather than
# glob-ignored, so that adding a *deliberate* image to the repository root
# stays a decision somebody makes rather than something this line swallows.
/controls.png
